#: ../../chapter05.rst:2
msgid "Active Directory Integration"
msgstr "Active Directory-integration"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:4
msgid "There are three ways to connect Active Directory into CentreStack."
msgstr "Der er tre måder at forbinde Active Directory med CentreStack på."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:8
msgid "1. LDAP"
msgstr "LDAP"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:10
msgid ""
"For the first way, if the Active Directory is in the same Local Area "
"Network (LAN), then a direct LDAP/LDAPS connection is recommended."
msgstr "For den første metode, hvis Active Directory er i det samme lokale område netværk (LAN), så anbefales en direkte LDAP/LDAPS forbindelse."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:15
msgid "2. Server Agent Proxy"
msgstr "2. Serveragentproxy"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:17
msgid ""
"For the Second way, if the Active Directory is in a remote office, such "
"as on a customer's premise, away from the CentreStack server, then a "
"client agent software called, \"File Server Agent\" can be installed on "
"the remote file server to help import Active Directory users over to "
"CentreStack."
msgstr "For det andet, hvis Active Directory befinder sig på et eksternt kontor, såsom hos en kunde, væk fra CentreStack-serveren, kan en klientagent-software kaldet \"File Server Agent\" installeres på den eksterne filserver for at hjælpe med at importere Active Directory-brugere over til CentreStack."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:23
msgid "CentreStack allows you to connect to multiple active directory services."
msgstr "CentreStack giver dig mulighed for at forbinde til flere active directory-tjenester."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:26
msgid "3. Azure AD Support"
msgstr "3. Azure AD Support"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:27
msgid ""
"Via the Azure AD support, you can setup Azure AD so users can be "
"authenticated by Azure AD instead of from a local Active Directory."
msgstr "Via Azure AD-supporten kan du opsætte Azure AD, så brugere kan blive godkendt af Azure AD i stedet for fra en lokal Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:31
msgid "**\"Proxied AD User\"**"
msgstr "**\"Proxied AD-bruger\"**"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:33
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use the Active Directory from a remote location "
"where the server agent (included client software) is used. In this case "
"\"Proxied AD User\" will be referred to users imported from server "
"agent's side of the Active Directory."
msgstr "Det er også muligt at bruge Active Directory fra en fjern placering, hvor serveragenten (inkluderet klientsoftware) anvendes. I dette tilfælde vil \"Proxied AD User\" referere til brugere importeret fra serveragentens side af Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:36
msgid "**\"AD User\"**"
msgstr "**\"AD Bruger\"**"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:38
msgid ""
"The \"AD user\" is reserved to refer to users from local LDAP Active "
"Directory."
msgstr "Begrebet \"AD bruger\" er forbeholdt brugere fra lokal LDAP Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:43
msgid ""
"When should you use LDAP, and when should you use \"Server Agent\" for AD"
" integration?"
msgstr "Hvornår skal du bruge LDAP, og hvornår skal du bruge \"Server Agent\" til AD-integration?"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:45
msgid "If AD is local to the CentreStack server, then LDAP is recommended."
msgstr "Hvis AD er lokal til CentreStack-serveren, anbefales LDAP."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:47
msgid "If AD is remote, then Server Agent is recommended."
msgstr "Hvis AD er fjern, anbefales Server Agent."

